      "id": "claim_f1a7fd3423784444a93c73c8a79d43c2",
      "statement": "The data migration toolchain is gitignored and not deployed: .gitignore excludes Data/, *.xlsx, *.xls, *.csv, and .claspignore permits only appsscript.json, Code/**/*.gs, html/**/*.html to push to GAS, so the Python scripts, MIGRATION.md, and source/build workbooks (employee PII) exist only on the operator's machine.",
