      "statement": "build.py uses a fixed TODAY (2026-06-29) and COOLDOWN (~183 days) for reproducible cooldown math, DEDUP_DAYS (120) to merge form-withdrawals with bank events that are the same real event (kept under COOLDOWN so distinct withdrawals never merge), COUNT_RULE='max' and COUNT_TERMINAL_REASONS=True as the two deferred decision switches.",
      "evidence": [
